
### Voucher / Booking Utilities

#### Generate Voucher Code
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/generate_voucher_code
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{}

#### Generate Booking Voucher
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/generate_booking_voucher
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "p_user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "p_space_unit_id": "SPACE_UNIT_ID"
}

#### Get Product Info
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/get_product_info
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "p_voucher_id": "VOUCHER_ID"
}

#### Get Voucher Info
POST {{base_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_voucher_info
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_voucher_id": "80a02f89-4a66-4333-84b0-1b13666497ad"
}

#### Validate Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/validate_booking
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_booking_id": "BOOKING_UUID",
  "p_user_id": "{{user_id}}"
}

#### Validate Time Within Bounds
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/validate_time_within_bounds
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "p_start": "07:00:00+08",
  "p_end": "10:00:00+08",
  "p_open": "08:00:00+08",
  "p_close": "18:00:00+08"
}

#### Validate Voucher Duration
POST {{base_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/validate_voucher_duration
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_start": "09:00:00+08:00",
  "p_end": "1:00:00+08:00",
  "p_duration": 3
}

#### Check Booking Status
POST {{base_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/check_booking_status
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_booking_id": "2e1f651b-ff35-47e5-85c8-ff51680bee55"
}

### Availability / Stats

#### Get Space Availability
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/get_space_availability
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "p_space_unit_id": "SPACE_UNIT_ID",
  "p_date": "2025-08-15"
}

