### Other Checks

#### Check Voucher If Refundable
POST {{base_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/check_refundable
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_is_refundable": false
}

#### Check Voucher If Used
POST {{base_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/check_used
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_status": "used"
}

#### Check Booking Cancellation Window
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/check_booking_cancellation_window
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_created_at": "2025-08-14"
}

#### Check Booking Overlap
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/check_booking_overlap
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "p_space_unit_id": "SPACE_UNIT_UUID",
  "p_date": "2025-08-15",
  "p_start": "09:00:00+08",
  "p_end": "10:00:00+08"
}

#### Check Booking If Cancellable
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/is_booking_cancellable
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_status": "BOOKING_ID_STATUS"
}

#### Prevent Booking For Past Date/Time
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/prevent_past_booking
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new": {
    "date": "2025-08-13",
    "start_time": "10:00:00+08",
    "end_time": "12:00:00+08"
  }
}

#### Reactivate Voucher
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/reactivate_voucher
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_voucher_id": "b05eb0c2-8c03-4076-9956-0c52791dbb95"
}

#### Log Cancellation
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/log_cancellation
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_booking_id": "BOOKING_UUID",
  "p_user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "p_remarks": "User requested cancellation"
}

#### Set Product Voucher To Used
POST http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1/rpc/set_product_voucher_used
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p_voucher_id": "REPLACE_WITH_VOUCHER_UUID"
}
